[metadata]
Name:Blitz - granted by Henzie
Goal:Cast Etali for the blitz cost Henzie grants and let it sacrifice itself at end step.
Turns:4
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Henzie grants blitz to creature spells with mana value 4 or greater. Etali exposes a blitz cast action, resolves with haste, then sacrifices itself and draws at the next end step. Gray Ogre has mana value 3 and gets no blitz action.

